  "rules": [
    "Original frozen plan controls, order, budgets and source binding retained; operator custody prose, receipt path and baseline path replaced with public equivalents.",
    "Profile copied byte-identically; declared normalized content hash and literal JSON byte hash are separately labeled.",
    "Native preflight/v2 schema, pass/fail verdicts, request usage, finish metadata and measured counts retained; endpoint replaced with synthetic loopback and all model response/validator prose omitted.",
    "Native job/adapter/result/event/grader structures and all grade/accounting/usage values retained. Endpoint/host/absolute paths and execution commands are synthetic or omitted; stdout/stderr/response prose are omitted. Embedded native hashes still identify original private stage bytes; this ledger and the final artifact manifest identify each public projection.",
    "Authoritative nested streaming usage reports30 reasoning tokens although the convenience field remains null. All seven raw preflight usage records are complete; Go totals remain a separate population and null is not zero."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Private process/store/route/source files are not part of the public bundle; raw private hashes bind their provenance without publishing operator identity.",
    "Ten owned Go responses form a separate population from seven router preflight observations; historical effort-control jobs are not pooled.",
    "The standalone CLI cannot inspect an outer benchmark-result envelope. Existing product APIs validated embedded native evidence and original stage hashes; no outer-CLI pass is claimed."
  ]
